# VPS deploy (tradecoachai.org)

Server: `/var/www/tradecoach` · PM2 apps: `tradecoach` (Next.js :3000), `tradecoach-api` (FastAPI :8000)

## nginx routing (critical)

| Host | Backend |
|------|---------|
| `tradecoachai.org` / `www` | Next.js `127.0.0.1:3000` (all paths, including `/api/*`) |
| `api.tradecoachai.org` | FastAPI `127.0.0.1:8000` |

Do **not** proxy `/api/sync/` on the app domain to FastAPI — that breaks web pairing (`/api/sync/devices`, `/api/sync/pairing-code`).

Always use `127.0.0.1` in `proxy_pass` — **not** `localhost` (IPv6 `::1` breaks).

## If site shows 502 but curl 127.0.0.1:3000 returns 200 (nginx issue)

```bash
cd /var/www/tradecoach
git pull
bash scripts/diagnose-nginx.sh
bash scripts/install-nginx.sh
```

```bash
cd /var/www/tradecoach
git pull
bash scripts/fix-502.sh
```

Then hard-refresh browser: **Ctrl+Shift+R** (or try incognito).

## If pairing / devices API returns `{"detail":"Not Found"}`

App sync is hitting FastAPI. Reinstall nginx config:

```bash
cd /var/www/tradecoach
git pull
bash scripts/install-nginx.sh
bash scripts/diagnose-nginx.sh
```

## Normal deploy (use this every time)

```bash
cd /var/www/tradecoach
git pull
bash scripts/deploy-vps.sh
```

Builds first, reloads PM2 (no delete), health-checks port 3000. Uses `npm run build:app` (skips extension zip to save memory).

## Diagnose when something breaks

```bash
cd /var/www/tradecoach
bash scripts/diagnose-vps.sh
bash scripts/diagnose-nginx.sh
pm2 logs tradecoach --lines 50
pm2 logs tradecoach-api --lines 50
```

## Fix API only (after ecosystem.config.cjs Python fix)

```bash
pm2 delete tradecoach-api 2>/dev/null || true
pm2 start ecosystem.config.cjs --only tradecoach-api
pm2 save
```

API must run via `.venv/bin/python -m uvicorn` — not Node on the uvicorn script.

## Do NOT do this (causes 502)

- Do **not** run `pm2 delete tradecoach` before a successful build
- Do **not** restart PM2 without `npm run build` / `build:app` when code changed
- Do **not** use `npm run build` on VPS unless extension zip is needed — prefer deploy script

## If build needed manually

```bash
NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=1536 npm run build:app
pm2 reload tradecoach --update-env
```

## 502 root cause

nginx is fine — nothing listening on :3000. Usually: deleted PM2 before build finished, incomplete `.next`, or app crash.
